msgid "Generate (Ctrl+G) makes new sounds for you. Pick a character, from power chords and fuzz bass to bells and space effects, and shape it with four dials: Bright opens the filter, Movement adds the LFO and modulation, Grit adds drive and noise, Ambience adds delay and reverb. Press Generate (or Space) for six sounds, and pick one, or move with the arrow keys, to hear it on the synth. Keep puts it in the slot selected in the list, as an edit you can undo and sync like any other. Vary deals six variations of a sound, Breed With crosses it with another, and Alt+Left goes back to an earlier hand. To give one of your sounds a new filter or new effects, select it and choose which of its stages to keep."
